            {
              "id": "pRwxPdwFFI",
              "data": {
                "text": "Meet Jany: The Chill Freeride Visionary",
                "level": 4
              },
              "type": "header",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "x5fZ5cTWo3",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Have you ever heard of a funny, mean guy from Eastern Europe? Sounds like a contradiction, right? Well, Jany is here to show you how it all comes together in the coolest way possible.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "HzsrAOzY-D",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jany isn't just any skier; he's a freeride visionary. Picture this: you're on a mountain, the snow is pristine, and endless lines are waiting to be shredded. Jany sees those lines like no one else. He doesn't just ski them; he owns them with a style that's both effortless and inspiring.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "w08HgYOTaq",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">With a laid-back attitude and a knack for finding the sickest routes, Jany makes freeriding look like pure art. He's the guy who turns every slope into his playground, and he's got the skills to back it up. Whether you're a skier or a snowboarder, you'll find yourself wanting to tag along on his epic adventures.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "D1F42SUJnd",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">So, if you're ready to embrace the chill vibes and see the mountains through Jany's eyes, keep an eye out for his next ride. Join the freeride community and get ready to shred like never before!</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "nDHTZDc3tN",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Follow Jany's Adventures and catch the latest lines he's carving. Don't miss out on the chance to see a true freeride visionary in action!</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "RHV66Gxy0r",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Meet Jan, the ultimate skiing and rock-climbing guru from the Czech Republic. This guy is one of the masterminds behind Snowbusters and Rockbusters. When winter rolls around, Jan shreds the slopes in Austria, always on the hunt for the gnarliest on and off-piste lines. Come summer, he's scaling rock faces like a pro. He's been living and breathing these sports for years, and it shows in his mad skills.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "B6RvSyDonv",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jan isn't just about the action; he's also got the language game on lock. Fluent in Czech, English, and Spanish, he's been sharing his passion for skiing since 2000. His journey started in Harrachov with JPK, then he hit up Spain's Sierra Nevada with the British Ski Centre and Rio Sport. These days, he's running his trips and courses, teaming up with the Frost ski school in Kaprun.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "Fc9ovbxLuz",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">As Jan puts it, \"I grew up near some tiny mountains in the Czech Republic and have been skiing since I was a baby. I started with a small ski team in my hometown, then took on the Alps. At 18, I got my first taste of Colorado powder and spent a whole season in Vail and Beaver Creek. Now, I'm stoked to share more epic skiing experiences with you.\"</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "a59oZ5Q3E7",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Ready to shred with Jan? Let's hit the slopes and rock faces together! Shred it deep &amp; steep!</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            }
          ],
