    {
      "sourceId": 5,
      "name": "Lukas Partl",
      "slug": "lukas-partl",
      "tagline": "Lukas has banked over 3,500 days on snow—he’s got a vertical odometer that won’t quit. He’s a Level 4 Examiner, but his true stoke is turning your ‘scared-to-send-it’ face into a ‘Goggles Up!’ grin. He diagnoses your shred issues before you hit the lift line and makes dropping that ridiculous line feel simple. Come ride with the legend who’s ready to find your next favorite line.",
      "descriptionSource": {
        "kind": "html",
        "value": "<p>Lukas has banked over 3,500 days on snow—he’s got a vertical odometer that won’t quit. He’s a Level 4 Examiner, but his true stoke is turning your ‘scared-to-send-it’ face into a ‘Goggles Up!’ grin. He diagnoses your shred issues before you hit the lift line and makes dropping that ridiculous line feel simple. Come ride with the legend who’s ready to find your next favorite line.</p>"
      },
      "contentSource": {
        "kind": "editorjs",
        "value": {
          "time": 1764859259989,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "I8uqFWue8N",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Years Skiing: 43</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "eSaOJJvMkq",
              "data": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "items": [],
                    "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Improve Your Off-Piste Riding  </span>"
                  },
                  {
                    "items": [],
                    "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Performance coaching - beginner to expert  </span>"
                  },
                  {
                    "items": [],
                    "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Salzburg Shred Safari  </span>"
                  }
                ],
                "style": "unordered"
              },
              "type": "list",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "AugBJ2Ze9H",
              "data": {
                "text": "Meet Lukas: The Vertical Odometer",
                "level": 3
              },
              "type": "header",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "y3YLzJUj-p",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Lukas is an absolute snow vet: 35 years in the white room, banking 3,500+ days. He’s not just a guide—he’s a Level 4 ISIA examiner, Alpine Coach, and a certified sensei in Telemark and Snowboard. </span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2nThsHcLhG",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">He took his Master’s in Physical Education and pointed it straight downhill, swapping the classroom for eight global ranges (from Japan to the USA). His superpower is hacking your technique using sports science, delivering the ultimate feeling: total confidence and the realization that the toughest lines are \"that simple.\" Get ready to send it, fully dialed.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "version": "2.30.5"
        }
      },
