    {
      "sourceId": 6,
      "name": "Jonas Kryl",
      "slug": "jonas-kryl",
      "tagline": "Jonas Kryl: Swedish-born, Austrian-certified, Staatlich geprüfter Skilehrer und Skiführer examiner. He brought his longboat to the Alps in '92, conquered every black diamond, and now teaches the pros how to carve. Don't be fooled by the summer rafting—this Viking lives for winter. Get ready to pillage the powder.",
      "descriptionSource": {
        "kind": "html",
        "value": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Jonas Kryl: Swedish-born, Austrian-certified, <strong>Staatlich geprüfter Skilehrer und Skiführer</strong> examiner. He brought his longboat to the Alps in '92, conquered every black diamond, and now teaches the pros how to carve. Don't be fooled by the summer rafting—this Viking lives for winter. Get ready to pillage the powder.</p>"
      },
      "contentSource": {
        "kind": "editorjs",
        "value": {
          "time": 1764859184115,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "tTezyO4gj7",
              "data": {
                "text": "Years Skiing: 48"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "dIZDXGt6zi",
              "data": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "items": [],
                    "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Improve Your Off-Piste Riding  </span>"
                  },
                  {
                    "items": [],
                    "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Performance coaching - beginner to expert  </span>"
                  },
                  {
                    "items": [],
                    "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Salzburg Shred Safari  </span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span>"
                  }
                ],
                "style": "unordered"
              },
              "type": "list",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "left"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "J0yA642-fb",
              "data": {
                "text": "Meet Jonas: The Alpine Viking",
                "level": 3
              },
              "type": "header",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "QSEyshHlx_",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jonas Kryl brings serious Swedish steel to the Austrian Alps. He's been dominating Zell am See – Kaprun since '92, moving from Snowboard Boss to Head Instructor and stacking certifications until he hit the Austrian summit: \"Staatlich geprüfter Skilehrer und Skiführer\" (the highest level, achieved in '02). </span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "z-qD60FTEH",
              "data": {
                "text": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Now, he's the examiner who teaches the instructors, switching seamlessly between carving clinics and dropping powder lines. Need a challenge? He spends his summers paddling class V whitewater. When Jonas guides, you're not just skiing; you're getting lessons from the guy who grades the pros. Fully stoked, fully certified, fully Frost.</span>"
              },
              "type": "paragraph",
              "tunes": {
                "alignTune": {
                  "alignment": "center"
                },
                "textVariantTune": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "version": "2.30.5"
        }
      },
